        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "British Galleries:\nHigh quality machine embroidery replicated work that would take a skilled embroiderer weeks to produce by hand.  James Houldsworth & Co. manufactured the machinery that produced this fine embroidery and showed this piece at the Dublin International Exhibition of 1853 to promote the sale of their machines. [27/03/2003]"@en ;
